1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:46,825 --> 00:01:48,345
-Cheers!
-Come on.

3
00:01:55,945 --> 00:01:57,065
Mengmeng.

4
00:01:58,025 --> 00:01:59,945
Do you remember our promise?

5
00:02:00,025 --> 00:02:01,305
We said

6
00:02:01,825 --> 00:02:04,465
if neither of us found someone we loved,

7
00:02:04,545 --> 00:02:06,105
I'd run a tavern,

8
00:02:06,185 --> 00:02:08,305
and you'd teach at a girls' school.

9
00:02:10,145 --> 00:02:11,785
When we grew old,

10
00:02:11,865 --> 00:02:13,785
we'd keep each other company
and never be lonely.

11
00:02:15,425 --> 00:02:17,065
Who would've thought

12
00:02:17,145 --> 00:02:18,385
you'd be getting married?

13
00:02:21,985 --> 00:02:23,945
Looks like fate has been kind to us.

14
00:02:26,065 --> 00:02:28,225
Zhili has Anian,

15
00:02:28,305 --> 00:02:29,545
I have His Majesty,

16
00:02:30,465 --> 00:02:31,865
and you have Young Lord Shen.

17
00:02:33,825 --> 00:02:34,665
Another toast.

18
00:02:34,745 --> 00:02:36,065
Cheers.

19
00:02:49,625 --> 00:02:50,465
Mengmeng.

20
00:02:50,545 --> 00:02:53,065
Ever since we came back
from the hot springs,

21
00:02:53,145 --> 00:02:54,865
you've been acting strange.

22
00:02:54,945 --> 00:02:56,585
Is something bothering you?

23
00:02:57,465 --> 00:02:58,985
If Mengmeng had something on her mind,

24
00:02:59,065 --> 00:03:00,705
wouldn't she tell you?

25
00:03:01,505 --> 00:03:02,585
She must be worried

26
00:03:02,665 --> 00:03:04,345
about tomorrow's wedding.

27
00:03:04,425 --> 00:03:05,705
To wear the phoenix crown,

28
00:03:05,785 --> 00:03:06,985
you must bear its weight.

29
00:03:07,065 --> 00:03:08,505
Becoming mistress of the Central Palace

30
00:03:09,065 --> 00:03:10,865
won't be as carefree
as serving at the Office.

31
00:03:10,945 --> 00:03:12,985
Relax.

32
00:03:13,065 --> 00:03:14,545
No matter how heavy the phoenix crown,

33
00:03:14,625 --> 00:03:17,145
all of us will be there
to help you carry it.

34
00:03:17,225 --> 00:03:18,225
Exactly.

35
00:03:18,825 --> 00:03:20,985
His Majesty will protect you at court.

36
00:03:21,065 --> 00:03:23,185
My brother and Anian
will watch over you in the palace.

37
00:03:23,265 --> 00:03:25,465
Fuzhi and I will stay by your side.

38
00:03:25,545 --> 00:03:28,505
And Yin Qing will keep you laughing.

39
00:03:28,585 --> 00:03:29,985
The five of us from the Office

40
00:03:30,065 --> 00:03:32,345
will always have your back.

41
00:03:32,425 --> 00:03:33,465
Come.

42
00:03:37,145 --> 00:03:38,305
Cheers.

43
00:03:43,505 --> 00:03:44,665
Cheers.

44
00:03:51,785 --> 00:03:54,025
I'm afraid this is all just a dream.

45
00:03:54,105 --> 00:03:55,545
And when I wake up,

46
00:03:56,905 --> 00:03:58,505
it'll all be gone.

47
00:04:06,905 --> 00:04:07,745
Mengmeng.

48
00:04:08,585 --> 00:04:10,865
If they ever wrong you in the palace,

49
00:04:11,345 --> 00:04:12,465
come back to Bofeng Tavern.

50
00:04:13,025 --> 00:04:14,465
This will always be your home.

51
00:04:15,065 --> 00:04:16,585
And I'll always be here for you.

52
00:04:16,665 --> 00:04:19,625
I don't care whether you live
in wealth and splendor.

53
00:04:19,705 --> 00:04:21,545
I only wish you

54
00:04:21,625 --> 00:04:23,505
joy and good health, year after year.

55
00:04:24,265 --> 00:04:25,465
Mengmeng.

56
00:04:26,305 --> 00:04:28,425
Whether you're Director Meng of the Office

57
00:04:28,505 --> 00:04:30,225
or Her Majesty the Empress
of the Central Palace,

58
00:04:30,985 --> 00:04:32,425
to me,

59
00:04:32,505 --> 00:04:35,065
you'll always be the sister
who helped me grow

60
00:04:35,585 --> 00:04:37,145
and kept me safe.

61
00:04:38,385 --> 00:04:39,905
You'll always be

62
00:04:39,985 --> 00:04:43,185
the girl I'm proudest of and admire most.

63
00:04:52,865 --> 00:04:53,985
All right.

64
00:04:54,585 --> 00:04:55,945
You're getting married tomorrow.

65
00:04:56,025 --> 00:04:57,465
No getting sentimental tonight.

66
00:04:57,545 --> 00:04:58,385
Come.

67
00:05:03,985 --> 00:05:05,225
Let's drink to...

68
00:05:05,745 --> 00:05:06,825
-The Empress of Daning!
-The Empress of Daning!

69
00:05:09,185 --> 00:05:10,265
And

70
00:05:10,345 --> 00:05:11,825
to nights when we can still drink like this.

71
00:05:41,065 --> 00:05:42,625
Your Highness.

72
00:05:42,705 --> 00:05:43,945
By this time tomorrow,

73
00:05:44,025 --> 00:05:45,345
every lantern in the capital

74
00:05:46,665 --> 00:05:47,865
will be covered in funeral white.

75
00:05:50,625 --> 00:05:52,345
Eight years of blood debt

76
00:05:52,425 --> 00:05:53,705
will finally be repaid.

77
00:05:53,785 --> 00:05:55,545
At the Battle of Humen Pass,

78
00:05:55,625 --> 00:05:57,585
when Ying Gua was still Crown Prince,

79
00:05:57,665 --> 00:06:00,145
that arrow pierced more
than my uncle's throat.

80
00:06:00,225 --> 00:06:02,625
It shattered the fortunes
of my mother's clan.

81
00:06:04,345 --> 00:06:05,345
After that,

82
00:06:05,985 --> 00:06:07,945
Father saw only my elder brother.

83
00:06:09,785 --> 00:06:11,225
What is he?

84
00:06:12,105 --> 00:06:13,625
Just a coward hiding in the royal tent,

85
00:06:13,705 --> 00:06:15,385
playing at schemes and power.

86
00:06:15,465 --> 00:06:16,505
Your Highness.

87
00:06:16,585 --> 00:06:18,305
The time for revenge has come.

88
00:06:19,425 --> 00:06:21,185
Daning's Left Chancellor believes

89
00:06:21,265 --> 00:06:22,745
you came to present warhorses

90
00:06:22,825 --> 00:06:24,225
and secure the marriage alliance.

91
00:06:26,625 --> 00:06:28,305
We already have the gate-opening warrant.

92
00:06:29,025 --> 00:06:31,465
Once the signal is given tomorrow,

93
00:06:31,545 --> 00:06:33,625
Beijian's Wolf Cavalry assassins

94
00:06:33,705 --> 00:06:35,145
can ride straight into the capital.

95
00:06:35,865 --> 00:06:36,705
Yes.

96
00:06:42,105 --> 00:06:43,625
I've kept you waiting, Second Prince.

97
00:06:47,225 --> 00:06:49,985
Mr. Shangguan, you leave no trace on snow.

98
00:06:50,065 --> 00:06:51,465
Even Beijian's Wind Listeners

99
00:06:51,545 --> 00:06:53,465
couldn't sense your presence.

100
00:06:53,545 --> 00:06:54,945
Truly remarkable.

101
00:06:55,025 --> 00:06:56,905
You're too kind, Second Prince.

102
00:06:57,545 --> 00:06:58,665
More importantly,

103
00:06:58,745 --> 00:07:01,025
you should be more concerned
with tomorrow's operation.

104
00:07:05,345 --> 00:07:06,865
At tomorrow's imperial wedding,

105
00:07:06,945 --> 00:07:08,665
the bridal procession must leave the Office

106
00:07:08,745 --> 00:07:09,945
and pass along Changle Street.

107
00:07:10,665 --> 00:07:12,665
We've already turned
the commander of its escort.

108
00:07:13,985 --> 00:07:16,385
He'll claim he's searching for assassins

109
00:07:16,465 --> 00:07:17,985
and draw away half the Imperial Guard.

110
00:07:18,065 --> 00:07:19,865
The alleys here form a maze.

111
00:07:19,945 --> 00:07:22,065
This is where Ying Gua will die.

112
00:07:24,225 --> 00:07:25,305
Sir,

113
00:07:25,385 --> 00:07:26,425
are you truly certain

114
00:07:26,505 --> 00:07:28,265
this ambush cannot fail?

115
00:07:28,905 --> 00:07:31,505
Ying Gua is sly as a fox.

116
00:07:31,585 --> 00:07:33,625
Back then, with only 3,000 light cavalry,

117
00:07:33,705 --> 00:07:35,585
he lured my army of 30,000
into a death trap.

118
00:07:35,665 --> 00:07:38,465
If this is another one of his schemes,

119
00:07:38,545 --> 00:07:40,785
you and I will be trapped
with nowhere to run.

120
00:07:40,865 --> 00:07:42,425
With our forces working
openly and in secret,

121
00:07:42,505 --> 00:07:44,425
Second Prince, you have nothing to fear.

122
00:07:44,505 --> 00:07:46,345
Your Highness's Wolf Cavalry
will strike head-on.

123
00:07:46,425 --> 00:07:48,745
My Blood Moon Society assassins
are already in place

124
00:07:48,825 --> 00:07:50,585
to support the Princess from the shadows.

125
00:07:51,585 --> 00:07:54,025
Even if Ying Gua casts a net
across heaven and earth,

126
00:07:54,105 --> 00:07:55,025
this wedding feast

127
00:07:55,585 --> 00:07:58,065
will still be his last meal.

128
00:07:59,865 --> 00:08:00,905
Interesting.

129
00:08:03,625 --> 00:08:06,625
But after all this time working with you,

130
00:08:07,145 --> 00:08:09,065
I've never seen your true face.

131
00:08:09,145 --> 00:08:11,265
The day Zhongwan is restored,

132
00:08:11,345 --> 00:08:13,425
this face hidden in dust for ten years

133
00:08:13,945 --> 00:08:15,705
will see daylight again.

134
00:08:17,385 --> 00:08:18,905
Then, Second Prince,

135
00:08:18,985 --> 00:08:21,225
we can drink wine from Ying Gua's skull.

136
00:08:26,545 --> 00:08:27,825
The Hour of the Rooster has passed.

137
00:08:28,385 --> 00:08:29,985
Ying Gua's death draws near.

138
00:08:30,945 --> 00:08:32,945
Daning's destiny

139
00:08:33,025 --> 00:08:34,545
has run its course too.

140
00:08:43,545 --> 00:08:45,705
This time, I'll do it myself

141
00:08:46,545 --> 00:08:48,305
and take Ying Gua's head.

142
00:08:50,665 --> 00:08:52,145
The imperial wedding of Emperor and Empress

143
00:08:52,225 --> 00:08:53,585
is a grand rite of state.

144
00:08:53,665 --> 00:08:54,985
We now present these betrothal gifts

145
00:08:55,065 --> 00:08:57,145
to show the Son of Heaven's solemn devotion

146
00:08:57,225 --> 00:08:59,745
and honor the Empress's virtue
as mother of the realm.

147
00:08:59,825 --> 00:09:02,785
Ten bolts of scarlet silk
with golden phoenix brocade,

148
00:09:02,865 --> 00:09:04,745
one pair of green-jade nuptial cups,

149
00:09:04,825 --> 00:09:07,065
one pair of kingfisher-feather
paired-phoenix vases,

150
00:09:07,145 --> 00:09:08,785
one black-glass pearl,

151
00:09:08,865 --> 00:09:10,705
one lingzhi-shaped ruyi scepter,

152
00:09:10,785 --> 00:09:13,265
and one set of gold-feather
phoenix hairpins.

153
00:09:13,345 --> 00:09:14,465
May dragon and phoenix bless this union.

154
00:09:14,545 --> 00:09:16,425
Will I still get to see you often

155
00:09:17,105 --> 00:09:18,345
after this, Your Majesty?

156
00:09:19,025 --> 00:09:19,945
Of course.

157
00:09:20,025 --> 00:09:21,945
I'll always be your Mengmeng.

158
00:09:22,025 --> 00:09:23,865
We promised not to cry today.

159
00:09:23,945 --> 00:09:26,265
We're sending Mengmeng off with smiles.

160
00:09:28,185 --> 00:09:30,545
The auspicious hour approaches.

161
00:09:30,625 --> 00:09:33,705
We respectfully invite
Her Majesty the Empress.

162
00:11:12,585 --> 00:11:14,945
I never thought those stories in the novels

163
00:11:15,025 --> 00:11:16,785
would actually come true.

164
00:11:16,865 --> 00:11:17,705
Shunzi.

165
00:11:17,785 --> 00:11:20,425
Go buy me a few more copies
of the Spring and Autumn Annals.

166
00:11:20,505 --> 00:11:21,665
Boss, what for?

167
00:11:22,625 --> 00:11:23,585
Obviously, next year

168
00:11:23,665 --> 00:11:25,345
I'm going to pass the metropolitan exam too.

169
00:11:39,505 --> 00:11:40,545
Your Highness.

170
00:11:40,625 --> 00:11:42,105
The phoenix palanquin has reached the
street.

171
00:11:43,745 --> 00:11:44,585
Look.

172
00:11:44,665 --> 00:11:46,025
What a sight.

173
00:11:48,385 --> 00:11:50,225
Die, Ying Gua.

174
00:11:56,865 --> 00:11:58,105
Run!

175
00:13:07,785 --> 00:13:09,465
You think stopping me

176
00:13:10,345 --> 00:13:11,785
means this is over?

177
00:13:16,145 --> 00:13:17,505
Back to the hall! Protect His Majesty!

178
00:13:21,345 --> 00:13:23,145
The auspicious hour has arrived.

179
00:13:23,225 --> 00:13:27,505
Escort Their Majesties into the hall
to honor the ancestors.

180
00:13:56,025 --> 00:13:59,185
Their Majesties, present the incense.

181
00:14:21,625 --> 00:14:24,105
First bow: to the Sacred Ancestor
who founded the realm.

182
00:14:28,105 --> 00:14:29,305
Yao'er.

183
00:14:29,985 --> 00:14:33,345
Second bow: may the realm endure forever.

184
00:14:40,425 --> 00:14:42,505
Third bow: may Emperor and Empress
be of one heart.

185
00:14:42,585 --> 00:14:44,705
Yao'er, kill him.

186
00:14:46,945 --> 00:14:48,425
-The rites are complete.
-Yao'er.

187
00:14:48,505 --> 00:14:50,025
Kill him.

188
00:14:51,745 --> 00:14:54,265
Yao'er, kill him.

189
00:14:55,345 --> 00:14:57,985
Yao'er, he destroyed your kingdom.

190
00:14:58,465 --> 00:14:59,665
Kill him.

191
00:14:59,745 --> 00:15:00,825
Yao'er.

192
00:15:00,905 --> 00:15:02,945
He destroyed your kingdom.

193
00:15:03,025 --> 00:15:04,105
Kill him.

194
00:15:20,305 --> 00:15:21,305
Yao'er.

195
00:15:22,345 --> 00:15:23,785
Kill him.

196
00:15:27,185 --> 00:15:28,305
Your Majesty.

197
00:15:31,025 --> 00:15:32,705
Guards! Protect His Majesty!

198
00:15:33,225 --> 00:15:34,305
Your Majesty.

199
00:15:34,385 --> 00:15:35,225
Mengmeng.

200
00:15:35,305 --> 00:15:36,465
What's wrong?

201
00:16:25,265 --> 00:16:26,945
One step closer

202
00:16:27,025 --> 00:16:28,065
and your Emperor

203
00:16:28,145 --> 00:16:29,665
dies without a burial place.

204
00:17:10,345 --> 00:17:12,025
Enough of your tricks.

205
00:17:12,105 --> 00:17:13,465
Who are you,

206
00:17:13,545 --> 00:17:16,025
to attempt regicide in Sacred Ancestor Hall?

207
00:17:17,305 --> 00:17:18,665
More than ten years ago,

208
00:17:19,265 --> 00:17:20,945
a hundred thousand of my people
were slaughtered.

209
00:17:22,145 --> 00:17:23,105
That blood debt...

210
00:17:24,985 --> 00:17:26,105
have you forgotten?

211
00:17:34,185 --> 00:17:35,905
A Zhongwan remnant.

212
00:17:37,305 --> 00:17:38,745
You destroyed our home and nation,

213
00:17:38,825 --> 00:17:41,025
then call us remnants?

214
00:17:41,105 --> 00:17:43,825
Today I'll use the Son of Heaven's blood

215
00:17:43,905 --> 00:17:46,625
to honor the dead of Zhongwan.

216
00:17:46,705 --> 00:17:48,305
I'll fight you to the death!

217
00:18:55,545 --> 00:18:56,825
Yin Qing?

218
00:18:56,905 --> 00:18:57,945
How could it be you?

219
00:19:05,145 --> 00:19:07,425
You've hidden behind a mask for so long.

220
00:19:07,945 --> 00:19:09,865
At last you show yourself.

221
00:19:09,945 --> 00:19:10,785
Did you truly think my palace

222
00:19:10,865 --> 00:19:12,505
was somewhere you could come and go
as you please?

223
00:19:20,665 --> 00:19:22,465
Mengmeng, you knew already?

224
00:19:31,945 --> 00:19:33,705
Yin Qing, your incense...

225
00:19:34,585 --> 00:19:35,985
I replaced it three days ago.

226
00:19:36,065 --> 00:19:38,025
Today I used myself as bait

227
00:19:38,105 --> 00:19:40,505
to draw all of you out.

228
00:19:40,585 --> 00:19:42,985
Do you know how long I've waited
for this moment?

229
00:19:43,065 --> 00:19:46,025
You joined forces with him to trap us?

230
00:20:14,425 --> 00:20:15,265
Reporting to Your Majesty.

231
00:20:16,025 --> 00:20:17,745
All nine gates around the hall are sealed.

232
00:20:17,825 --> 00:20:20,345
None of them will escape today.

233
00:20:20,425 --> 00:20:23,225
Beijian's Second Prince
and his Wolf Cavalry are destroyed.

234
00:20:23,305 --> 00:20:25,225
The Blood Moon Society
has no one left to rely on.

235
00:20:25,985 --> 00:20:27,785
-Impossible.
-Left Chancellor.

236
00:20:28,745 --> 00:20:31,345
You privately issued tribute credentials

237
00:20:31,425 --> 00:20:33,425
that allowed Beijian's Second Prince

238
00:20:33,505 --> 00:20:34,745
to ally with the Blood Moon Society

239
00:20:34,825 --> 00:20:36,105
and sneak armed men into the capital.

240
00:20:36,185 --> 00:20:37,105
Your Majesty, please hear me.

241
00:20:37,825 --> 00:20:39,225
I must have fallen for a traitor's scheme

242
00:20:39,305 --> 00:20:41,305
when I issued those tribute credentials.

243
00:20:41,385 --> 00:20:43,545
Your Majesty, what matters most now

244
00:20:43,625 --> 00:20:45,465
is exterminating the Zhongwan remnants.

245
00:20:46,825 --> 00:20:47,825
Ying Gua.

246
00:20:49,145 --> 00:20:50,705
I came here today

247
00:20:51,465 --> 00:20:53,425
with no intention of leaving alive.

248
00:20:54,665 --> 00:20:55,985
Seize him.

249
00:21:14,705 --> 00:21:16,825
Yin Qing, stop.

250
00:21:16,905 --> 00:21:17,985
Don't cling to this madness.

251
00:21:18,065 --> 00:21:19,185
You're the one lost in madness.

252
00:21:20,025 --> 00:21:22,225
I endured humiliation and planned every step

253
00:21:22,305 --> 00:21:24,185
to raise you above everyone else in Daning.

254
00:21:24,265 --> 00:21:25,865
Kill Ying Gua today,

255
00:21:26,825 --> 00:21:28,265
and Zhongwan can be restored.

256
00:21:29,225 --> 00:21:30,265
Restore the kingdom?

257
00:21:30,345 --> 00:21:31,985
That would only uproot the people.

258
00:21:33,145 --> 00:21:34,265
This blood feud...

259
00:21:34,345 --> 00:21:35,185
I would rather not avenge it.

260
00:21:36,825 --> 00:21:37,665
Besides,

261
00:21:38,705 --> 00:21:40,345
I am now a citizen of Daning.

262
00:21:42,825 --> 00:21:44,905
Director Meng is in league
with the Blood Moon Society?

263
00:21:44,985 --> 00:21:46,025
-Impossible.
-Impossible.

264
00:21:46,945 --> 00:21:48,905
Seize every remaining member

265
00:21:48,985 --> 00:21:50,265
of the Blood Moon Society.

266
00:21:50,345 --> 00:21:52,105
You forced my hand.

267
00:22:30,025 --> 00:22:31,705
Look closely.

268
00:22:32,305 --> 00:22:35,105
Would you truly let her become
Empress of Daning?

269
00:22:35,865 --> 00:22:38,025
The Mystic Bird emblem?

270
00:22:39,705 --> 00:22:42,265
The mark of Zhongwan royalty.

271
00:22:43,025 --> 00:22:44,465
You're the Princess of Zhongwan.

272
00:22:45,185 --> 00:22:46,945
A Zhongwan princess

273
00:22:47,025 --> 00:22:49,945
has been manipulating Daning's court?

274
00:22:50,025 --> 00:22:50,985
Guards!

275
00:22:51,065 --> 00:22:52,865
Execute her on the spot.

276
00:22:52,945 --> 00:22:54,425
Who dares?

277
00:22:56,545 --> 00:22:57,585
Your Majesty.

278
00:22:58,665 --> 00:23:01,665
Did you know her identity all along?

279
00:23:02,545 --> 00:23:03,785
Your Majesty.

280
00:23:03,865 --> 00:23:05,625
Are you going to hand Daning

281
00:23:05,705 --> 00:23:08,185
over to the remnants of Zhongwan?

282
00:23:08,265 --> 00:23:09,665
Meng Tinghui previously

283
00:23:09,745 --> 00:23:11,865
knew nothing of her birth.

284
00:23:12,425 --> 00:23:14,705
But everything she has done for Daning,

285
00:23:15,345 --> 00:23:16,865
I know better than anyone.

286
00:23:17,385 --> 00:23:18,905
Stop pretending, Princess.

287
00:23:19,705 --> 00:23:21,745
We planned the Infinity Pill disaster
together.

288
00:23:22,305 --> 00:23:23,945
Gu Qin's execution,

289
00:23:24,025 --> 00:23:25,825
the collapse of the Beijian
marriage alliance—

290
00:23:25,905 --> 00:23:27,585
all of it was to plunge Daning

291
00:23:27,665 --> 00:23:28,945
into crisis at home and abroad.

292
00:23:29,025 --> 00:23:31,705
You think if you cut off
every path she has in Daning

293
00:23:32,225 --> 00:23:34,185
and pin every disaster on her,

294
00:23:34,265 --> 00:23:36,025
she'll restore Zhongwan with you?

295
00:23:36,105 --> 00:23:37,745
You keep her beside you

296
00:23:38,305 --> 00:23:39,785
only because you want to use her too.

297
00:23:39,865 --> 00:23:41,265
Between you will always stand

298
00:23:41,345 --> 00:23:42,905
the hundred thousand dead of Zhongwan.

299
00:23:42,985 --> 00:23:44,905
You can never be together.

300
00:23:45,505 --> 00:23:47,505
Your Majesty, no more words.

301
00:23:47,585 --> 00:23:49,705
Execute this witch
and the Zhongwan remnants at once

302
00:23:49,785 --> 00:23:51,105
and end the threat forever.

303
00:23:51,185 --> 00:23:53,705
You all keep calling me
a witch who will ruin the realm.

304
00:24:07,745 --> 00:24:09,865
Today I'll carve away
this Mystic Bird emblem

305
00:24:09,945 --> 00:24:11,705
and show you where my loyalty lies.

306
00:24:11,785 --> 00:24:12,665
Don't!

307
00:24:49,945 --> 00:24:52,145
The Mystic Bird emblem is destroyed.

308
00:24:53,665 --> 00:24:55,305
I am no longer the Princess of Zhongwan.

309
00:24:56,905 --> 00:24:58,385
I am only Meng Tinghui.

310
00:25:44,185 --> 00:25:45,185
Left Chancellor...

311
00:25:47,545 --> 00:25:49,825
If you want to harm His Majesty of Daning,

312
00:25:49,905 --> 00:25:53,065
you'll have to step over
Xu Ting's body first.

313
00:26:05,065 --> 00:26:07,465
-Left Chancellor.
-Left Chancellor.

314
00:26:07,545 --> 00:26:09,625
-Chancellor!
-Left Chancellor, wake up!

315
00:26:10,265 --> 00:26:11,185
Fetch the imperial physician!

316
00:26:11,265 --> 00:26:12,345
-Quickly!
-Yes!

317
00:26:12,425 --> 00:26:14,305
-Imperial physician...
-Your Majesty.

318
00:26:20,505 --> 00:26:21,425
Your Majesty.

319
00:26:23,225 --> 00:26:24,985
I was wrong before.

320
00:26:27,305 --> 00:26:28,705
Please... don't hold it against me.

321
00:26:40,905 --> 00:26:42,305
I...

322
00:26:44,545 --> 00:26:47,065
can no longer serve Your Majesty.

323
00:26:47,945 --> 00:26:50,025
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

324
00:26:50,105 --> 00:26:51,625
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

325
00:26:56,305 --> 00:27:00,385
-Chancellor!
-Chancellor!

326
00:27:05,505 --> 00:27:06,545
Chancellor.

327
00:27:15,185 --> 00:27:16,465
Princess.

328
00:27:17,385 --> 00:27:19,025
We should be happy.

329
00:27:19,625 --> 00:27:20,585
I avenged you,

330
00:27:21,545 --> 00:27:23,185
and my younger sister as well.

331
00:27:47,025 --> 00:27:49,705
Kill

332
00:27:50,305 --> 00:27:52,385
every last Blood Moon remnant.

333
00:28:54,545 --> 00:28:56,665
Xu Ting is dead,

334
00:28:56,745 --> 00:28:58,305
and now your heart aches?

335
00:29:00,425 --> 00:29:02,065
When Daning's iron cavalry

336
00:29:02,145 --> 00:29:04,505
slaughtered my people of Zhongwan,

337
00:29:05,345 --> 00:29:07,585
do you know how it tore my heart apart?

338
00:29:08,105 --> 00:29:09,745
You and I,

339
00:29:09,825 --> 00:29:11,505
Zhongwan and Daning,

340
00:29:11,585 --> 00:29:12,785
can never share the same sky.

341
00:29:15,025 --> 00:29:18,385
If this blood feud can never be settled,

342
00:29:19,825 --> 00:29:21,545
then today I'll use your life

343
00:29:23,145 --> 00:29:25,625
to end it once and for all.

344
00:29:50,345 --> 00:29:51,385
Sir.

345
00:29:52,105 --> 00:29:53,265
Your Majesty.

346
00:29:53,345 --> 00:29:54,545
Mengmeng.

347
00:30:00,665 --> 00:30:03,545
Haven't Daning and Zhongwan
shed enough blood?

348
00:30:05,745 --> 00:30:07,705
Your Majesty, please spare Yin Qing.

349
00:30:08,825 --> 00:30:11,265
The hairpin I gave you with my own hands...

350
00:30:13,065 --> 00:30:15,425
and you use it to threaten me?

351
00:30:15,505 --> 00:30:17,145
I know Your Majesty hates Yin Qing,

352
00:30:18,145 --> 00:30:20,705
but I can't watch him die.

353
00:30:21,985 --> 00:30:23,145
And I can't stand by

354
00:30:23,225 --> 00:30:25,465
while hatred between Daning
and Zhongwan deepens.

355
00:30:26,345 --> 00:30:28,305
The Left Chancellor died protecting me.

356
00:30:28,825 --> 00:30:30,625
If I don't kill him today,

357
00:30:31,305 --> 00:30:34,185
what right have I to defend the realm
and protect the people?

358
00:30:34,265 --> 00:30:35,345
Today

359
00:30:36,145 --> 00:30:37,505
is the day he dies.

360
00:30:39,505 --> 00:30:40,585
Stop!

361
00:30:41,145 --> 00:30:42,425
I am protecting Yin Qing

362
00:30:43,665 --> 00:30:46,025
for Daning's sake as well.

363
00:30:49,985 --> 00:30:52,065
Your Majesty, Meng Tinghui
has bewitched your heart.

364
00:30:52,145 --> 00:30:54,145
You must not release
the mastermind behind this.

365
00:30:54,225 --> 00:30:55,785
I beg Your Majesty

366
00:30:55,865 --> 00:30:57,945
to execute the Princess of Zhongwan
and her followers

367
00:30:58,025 --> 00:30:59,145
and bring peace to the realm.

368
00:30:59,225 --> 00:31:00,265
Your Majesty.

369
00:31:00,345 --> 00:31:01,825
Spare the tiger, and disaster will follow.

370
00:31:02,665 --> 00:31:04,025
Today we absolutely cannot

371
00:31:04,105 --> 00:31:05,905
let them leave Sacred Ancestor Hall.

372
00:31:05,985 --> 00:31:06,825
Anian.

373
00:31:06,905 --> 00:31:08,225
Must you really kill every last one?

374
00:31:08,305 --> 00:31:09,225
Your Majesty.

375
00:31:09,305 --> 00:31:10,345
We failed to root them out before.

376
00:31:10,425 --> 00:31:11,585
That caused today's calamity.

377
00:31:11,665 --> 00:31:13,105
We must not repeat that mistake.

378
00:31:13,185 --> 00:31:15,665
Zhishu, you know Mengmeng
would never harm His Majesty.

379
00:31:15,745 --> 00:31:17,585
-Please...
-We beg Your Majesty

380
00:31:17,665 --> 00:31:20,745
to execute the Princess of Zhongwan
and her followers

381
00:31:20,825 --> 00:31:22,185
and bring peace to the realm.

382
00:32:13,865 --> 00:32:14,985
The phoenix pendant is broken.

383
00:32:15,905 --> 00:32:17,385
Our private bond is ended.

384
00:32:18,025 --> 00:32:20,785
But I will not yield one inch
of Daning's realm.

385
00:32:24,425 --> 00:32:25,585
Let them go.

386
00:32:26,145 --> 00:32:27,545
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

387
00:33:58,905 --> 00:34:00,825
The dragon throne sways,

388
00:34:00,905 --> 00:34:02,905
the witch beguiles,

389
00:34:02,985 --> 00:34:05,305
loyal ministers fall,

390
00:34:05,385 --> 00:34:07,105
the frontiers burn.

391
00:34:07,185 --> 00:34:08,825
The Emperor is besotted,

392
00:34:08,905 --> 00:34:11,465
the realm withers.

393
00:34:11,545 --> 00:34:13,345
The dragon throne sways,

394
00:34:13,425 --> 00:34:15,425
the witch beguiles,

395
00:34:15,505 --> 00:34:17,585
loyal ministers fall,

396
00:34:17,665 --> 00:34:19,905
the frontiers burn.

397
00:34:45,585 --> 00:34:46,465
Proprietor Yan.

398
00:34:46,545 --> 00:34:49,545
Will Lord Meng really restore Zhongwan
and attack Daning?

399
00:34:50,985 --> 00:34:51,865
-Proprietor Yan!
-Boss!

400
00:34:51,945 --> 00:34:53,105
Bad news!

401
00:34:53,185 --> 00:34:54,025
War is coming!

402
00:34:54,105 --> 00:34:55,945
My relatives at the border saw enemy troops.

403
00:34:56,945 --> 00:34:59,105
Then let's hurry and stockpile grain.

404
00:34:59,185 --> 00:35:00,025
If war really breaks out,

405
00:35:00,105 --> 00:35:01,665
grain will be what keeps us alive.

406
00:35:01,745 --> 00:35:02,585
Yes.

407
00:35:07,985 --> 00:35:09,825
-Your Majesty.
-Grand Tutor, no need for ceremony.

408
00:35:11,105 --> 00:35:11,945
Please sit.

409
00:35:18,225 --> 00:35:19,865
I assume you've already heard

410
00:35:20,425 --> 00:35:22,345
that they're calling me a foolish ruler now?

411
00:35:22,425 --> 00:35:23,545
In my view,

412
00:35:24,145 --> 00:35:27,025
Your Majesty made the realm your board
and benevolence your bait.

413
00:35:27,105 --> 00:35:28,785
That is great wisdom.

414
00:35:28,865 --> 00:35:30,705
Zhishu tells me

415
00:35:30,785 --> 00:35:33,745
Your Majesty intends to issue
a new policy for Zhongwan.

416
00:35:33,825 --> 00:35:36,465
Those who submit will be freed
from slave status and granted farmland.

417
00:35:36,545 --> 00:35:38,625
They may enter government
through the examinations.

418
00:35:39,465 --> 00:35:40,305
This measure

419
00:35:41,105 --> 00:35:42,465
will show Zhongwan's survivors

420
00:35:42,545 --> 00:35:43,905
Daning's sincerity.

421
00:35:43,985 --> 00:35:45,225
I'll bear the infamy.

422
00:35:45,945 --> 00:35:47,425
But this game for the realm

423
00:35:48,025 --> 00:35:49,945
will be played by my rules.

424
00:35:50,505 --> 00:35:52,425
Your Majesty means to lead
the campaign personally?

425
00:35:54,345 --> 00:35:56,665
With both chancellorships vacant
and the court unsettled,

426
00:35:56,745 --> 00:35:59,025
and Beijian's wolfish ambitions,

427
00:35:59,105 --> 00:36:00,225
colluding with Zhongwan remnants

428
00:36:00,305 --> 00:36:01,385
to attack Your Majesty,

429
00:36:01,465 --> 00:36:02,905
this journey will be perilous.

430
00:36:02,985 --> 00:36:04,065
The realm needs a leader.

431
00:36:04,145 --> 00:36:06,145
I asked you here today

432
00:36:06,225 --> 00:36:08,065
precisely to have you hold the court

433
00:36:08,145 --> 00:36:10,225
and oversee the Six Ministries
to keep the court stable.

434
00:36:11,545 --> 00:36:13,905
I let Yin Qing leave
Sacred Ancestor Hall that day

435
00:36:13,985 --> 00:36:15,305
not for Meng Tinghui.

436
00:36:15,385 --> 00:36:17,505
Yin Qing leads
the Zhongwan survivors.

437
00:36:17,585 --> 00:36:19,665
If we killed him
in Daning's Sacred Ancestor Hall,

438
00:36:19,745 --> 00:36:21,505
it would inflame resentment
among those survivors.

439
00:36:22,185 --> 00:36:23,865
Then Daning would face

440
00:36:23,945 --> 00:36:26,145
encirclement by Zhongwan and Beijian.

441
00:36:26,225 --> 00:36:28,145
We must fight Beijian sooner or later.

442
00:36:28,225 --> 00:36:30,665
So we might as well strike first.

443
00:36:31,625 --> 00:36:33,305
Besides, that day Meng Tinghui

444
00:36:33,385 --> 00:36:34,745
was gambling with her life too.

445
00:36:35,425 --> 00:36:38,065
She was betting I could find a third path,

446
00:36:38,145 --> 00:36:39,385
one different from Father's

447
00:36:39,465 --> 00:36:41,305
for resolving the feud
between our two states.

448
00:36:42,065 --> 00:36:44,225
When you taught me the art of kingship,
you said

449
00:36:44,305 --> 00:36:46,025
a true ruler of all under Heaven

450
00:36:46,105 --> 00:36:47,945
must be broad enough to embrace the realm.

451
00:36:48,865 --> 00:36:49,905
I intend to unite

452
00:36:49,985 --> 00:36:51,745
this fractured realm

453
00:36:51,825 --> 00:36:53,625
and give the people
an age of peace and prosperity.

454
00:36:59,505 --> 00:37:00,945
Grand Tutor, will you help me

455
00:37:02,025 --> 00:37:03,665
play this game?

456
00:37:09,625 --> 00:37:10,705
I once said:

457
00:37:11,345 --> 00:37:12,865
all under Heaven is a chessboard,

458
00:37:12,945 --> 00:37:14,345
and the sovereign is the player.

459
00:37:16,145 --> 00:37:16,985
I

460
00:37:18,425 --> 00:37:19,665
am willing to take up this game

461
00:37:20,545 --> 00:37:22,065
for Your Majesty.

462
00:37:26,785 --> 00:37:28,825
I have not attended court in ten years.

463
00:37:30,345 --> 00:37:31,705
I never imagined

464
00:37:33,225 --> 00:37:34,505
I

465
00:37:34,585 --> 00:37:36,585
could once again
share Your Majesty's burdens

466
00:37:37,425 --> 00:37:40,545
and serve Daning.

467
00:37:40,625 --> 00:37:42,105
With you holding the court,

468
00:37:42,665 --> 00:37:44,705
I can campaign without worry behind me.

469
00:37:45,185 --> 00:37:46,505
From this day forward,

470
00:37:47,185 --> 00:37:48,345
you will govern in my stead,

471
00:37:48,985 --> 00:37:50,305
and oversee the Six Ministries.

472
00:37:50,385 --> 00:37:52,865
I will not fail this trust.

473
00:37:53,945 --> 00:37:55,465
I will do all in my power

474
00:37:55,545 --> 00:37:57,585
to keep Daning's court secure

475
00:37:57,665 --> 00:37:59,705
and await Your Majesty's triumphant return.

476
00:38:01,145 --> 00:38:01,985
Your Majesty.

477
00:38:02,065 --> 00:38:03,585
Yin Qing's group entered old Zhongwan lands
in Qingzhou.

478
00:38:03,665 --> 00:38:05,745
Beijian has massed troops at the border
but has not moved.

479
00:38:06,585 --> 00:38:08,505
Yeqi is drilling troops at Qingxia Pass
as a show of force.

480
00:38:08,585 --> 00:38:10,225
Taishui cavalry raided
our Jizhou camp at night,

481
00:38:10,305 --> 00:38:12,025
burning three of our army's granaries.

482
00:38:12,105 --> 00:38:13,825
War is breaking out everywhere.
We cannot delay.

483
00:38:16,145 --> 00:38:17,905
Daning's forces will advance
on three fronts.

484
00:38:17,985 --> 00:38:18,825
Shen Zhishu.

485
00:38:19,465 --> 00:38:21,265
Lead your army to Yeqi. Tell its king

486
00:38:21,345 --> 00:38:23,345
whether he will be Daning's enemy or friend

487
00:38:23,425 --> 00:38:24,665
is his choice to weigh.

488
00:38:25,385 --> 00:38:27,145
-I obey.
-Di Nian.

489
00:38:27,225 --> 00:38:28,545
Lead an elite force against Taishui.

490
00:38:28,625 --> 00:38:30,505
You must take the city within seven days.

491
00:38:30,585 --> 00:38:32,105
I will not fail Your Majesty.

492
00:38:32,185 --> 00:38:33,025
Your Majesty.

493
00:38:33,105 --> 00:38:34,545
When the Second Prince's body returns,

494
00:38:34,625 --> 00:38:35,865
Beijian will seize the chance to attack.

495
00:38:35,945 --> 00:38:37,025
Then we'd face war on two fronts.

496
00:38:37,105 --> 00:38:38,265
No need to wait for Beijian.

497
00:38:38,745 --> 00:38:39,745
Three days from now,

498
00:38:39,825 --> 00:38:41,585
I will personally lead the army
against Beijian.

499
00:38:41,665 --> 00:38:42,865
I'll make them understand

500
00:38:43,465 --> 00:38:45,905
Daning is not theirs to trample at will.

501
00:38:47,985 --> 00:38:49,665
I request to serve as the vanguard.

502
00:38:50,305 --> 00:38:52,425
I owe the Left Chancellor a great debt.

503
00:38:52,505 --> 00:38:54,065
I must avenge him.

504
00:38:55,225 --> 00:38:56,665
Even if I am shattered to pieces,

505
00:38:56,745 --> 00:38:57,665
I will not hesitate.

506
00:38:58,785 --> 00:38:59,665
Good.

507
00:39:00,865 --> 00:39:01,745
Soldiers.

508
00:39:01,825 --> 00:39:03,585
Powerful enemies surround us.

509
00:39:03,665 --> 00:39:05,145
One step back

510
00:39:05,225 --> 00:39:06,705
and our mountains and rivers shatter.

511
00:39:06,785 --> 00:39:08,065
One step forward

512
00:39:08,145 --> 00:39:09,745
and our iron bones forge the walls.

513
00:39:09,825 --> 00:39:12,505
I will live and die with every soldier.

514
00:39:12,585 --> 00:39:14,425
Defend our land!

515
00:39:15,225 --> 00:39:17,185
Protect our people!

516
00:39:17,265 --> 00:39:18,825
Defend our land!

517
00:39:18,905 --> 00:39:20,705
Protect our people!

518
00:39:20,785 --> 00:39:21,945
Defend our land!

519
00:39:22,025 --> 00:39:23,825
Protect our people!

520
00:39:23,905 --> 00:39:25,545
Defend our land!

521
00:39:25,625 --> 00:39:27,265
Protect our people!

522
00:39:40,025 --> 00:39:40,865
Princess.

523
00:39:42,705 --> 00:39:44,985
This is the detached palace
where you often lived as a child.

524
00:39:46,505 --> 00:39:47,545
Do you remember it?

525
00:39:48,345 --> 00:39:49,705
I've seen it in dreams.

526
00:39:55,585 --> 00:39:58,265
Here are enshrined the spirit tablets
of Zhongwan's royal kin

527
00:39:58,345 --> 00:39:59,825
and loyal martyrs.

528
00:40:00,625 --> 00:40:01,905
Every midnight,

529
00:40:02,785 --> 00:40:04,785
you can hear them weeping.

530
00:40:05,465 --> 00:40:06,905
After Zhongwan fell,

531
00:40:08,105 --> 00:40:09,825
Daning neglected this palace too.

532
00:40:10,465 --> 00:40:12,625
So we secretly established ourselves here.

533
00:40:12,705 --> 00:40:13,665
On the first night,

534
00:40:15,105 --> 00:40:17,945
many of our people were driven mad
by phantom cries.

535
00:40:23,305 --> 00:40:24,145
Mr. Shangguan.

536
00:40:24,225 --> 00:40:26,105
The old clan chief
has been waiting for some time.

